<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech RPIX dips at mid-session as KB loses ground.</title>
<headline>Czech RPIX dips at mid-session as KB loses ground.</headline>
<text>
<p>1045 GMT - The Czech RPIX drops back at mid-session on Monday as Komercni Banka loses most early gains.</p>
<p>*  .RPIX falls 14.1 points, 1.41 percent, to 986.9.</p>
<p>* Turnover, 21 million crowns.</p>
<p>* Komercni up two crowns to 1,803 after gaining 54 crowns at the fixing.</p>
<p>* SPT Telecom extends losses, down 70 crowns to 2,900.</p>
<p>* IPB down 21 crowns, 7.3 percent, to 266.</p>
<p>-- Robin Shepherd, Prague Newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
